[1m[38;5;231mWhat will the stored identity be used for?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mLabel only (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mLogging and attaching to form submissions. Server authenticates every request independently. Store is untrusted.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Label + auth token
     [38;5;246mStore also holds a credential. Requires an httpOnly cookie for the token; identity and credential live separately.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Gates the UI
     [38;5;246mApp reads stored userId to decide what to show or allow. Spoofable by editing one storage value.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m Not decided yet
     [38;5;246mDesign for label-only now, note the upgrade path in the spec, and revisit when the server side is real.[39m
